      "node_id": "kg_doc_10",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Ralphie the Buffalo is the name of the live mascot of the University of Colorado Buffaloes. Ralphie has been called one of the best live mascots in sports, and she is often erroneously labeled male.",
